	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Pooled CRISPR screening in pancreatic cancer cells implicates co-repressor complexes as a cause of multiple drug resistance via regulation of epithelial-to-mesenchymal transition [ChIP-seq]</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">We performed ChIP-seq ananlysis on HDAC1 in MiaPaCa2 using two different antibodies (Santa Cruz Biotechnologies sc-81598 HDAC1(10E2) and Invitrogen HDAC1 Polyclonal Antibody PA1-860), two non-targeting scrableled sgRNA controls and two replicates for each.</Item>
